## 10. Security

The `.env` file contains private MongoDB connection details. It is excluded from GitHub and the submission ZIP. The virtual environment is also excluded because dependencies can be installed from `requirements.txt`.

## 11. Conclusion

This project demonstrates how to create a Flask JSON API, build a frontend form, save data to MongoDB Atlas, and implement success and error handling.

Before submission, the documentation, screenshots, GitHub link, and final ZIP file must be checked for completeness.